  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project - Strengthening Advocacy and Community Engagement Efforts to Address Child Undernutrition and Climate Change, is designed to contribute to the Government of Sierra Leone&#x2019;s Medium Term National Development Plan (cluster five: empowering women, children, adolescents, and persons with disability) , United Nations Food System Summit Commitments (pathway one: increasing agricultural productivity using climate smart agricultural approaches and pathway four: improve access to rural credit to support rural farmers) and Nutrition for Growth Commitments (reducing the prevalence of stunting from 29.5% in 2019 to 25% in 2025 and increasing exclusive breastfeeding rates from 54% in 2019 to 70% in 2025).</narrative>
  </description>
